damagefactor "Flames", 0.01
damagefactor "Fire", 0.01
Health 20
Radius 18
Height 24
BloodType "HitPuff"
PainChance 255
DamageType "Extreme"
Deathsound "FAREXPL"
+NOGRAVITY
+SHOOTABLE
+NOTELEPORT
+SOLID
+NODAMAGETHRUST
-THRUGHOST
+NORADIUSDMG
-GHOST
States
{
Spawn:
XXXX A 7
Stop

Pain:
